Package: niaos-root-preparation
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd (>= 257), mount
Suggests: niaos-pkgcore
Description: Internal NiaOS root preparation service
 Materializes retained native root archives in protected inactive storage.
 The native core owns admission and the installed package state.
 Initial storage provisioning and activation are explicit installer actions.
